@ckkumar @KAvasarala @priyaramani The interruption is irrelevant now. Its a storm now. It will do what it does.

For long, women have been scared &amp; ashamed for something that happened to them. They are breaking free from fear &amp; will not stop. Every cupboard will be opened, each skeleton out!  #MeTooIndia
#MeToo

@MasalaBai Male bonding when higher than principles in life is a cheap sight!

All support for the brave women raising the #MeToo flag.
#MahilaBol

@htshowbiz The creep is pinned already here! #pinthecreep
#SexualHarassment 
#MeToo

@mitalisaran Tag every media in the world! 
Let them know all about external affairs!
#MeToo

@timesofindia @htTweets @dna: Vital that you #SexualHarassment Workshops For All Your Employees To Prevent Future incidents of Sexual #Abuse!
Sign the Petition! - https://t.co/Y7pdCIyKne via @ChangeOrg_India
#ThursdayThoughts #MeToo

@RavieDhiman1 @anupam_456 @_YogendraYadav @IndianExpress I refuse to chat further if your stuff is political, is fiction &amp; out of a negative retaliatory approach. Learn fairness first.
Talk sense, we talk else be happy writing for yourself. 

#MeToo is a serious theme, discussion and it pertains to real experiences in lives of people

@TheRestlessQuil An ugly side which can never be hidden with any or many exhibitions of sophisticated, intellectual &amp; humane concerns/ aspects of this man!
#MeToo is a lens that doesn't spare anyone for their misdeeds!

#MahilaBol on #SexualHarassment by 'gentlemen' around them.

@dhanyarajendran I wonder how many really decent guys &amp; gentlemen exist in the industry (media, movies, advertising) or, any at all?

Innocent faces, talented men, people you have met &amp; discussed social projects with are the found to be perpetrators &amp; repeat offenders! #sexualharassment
#MeToo

@tavleen_singh What does! Keeping mum and bearing it while watching others go through the same as well.
What reform has ever come in society without voices!
Think of all judgements in recent years of you have the time. Everything blooms in its time. #MeToo has. Accept it.

@redheadchopra I find the men there absolutely dirty! Dirty in the mind, first.

The fact they look at a woman employee not as a person with talent /skill sets but as a sexual consumable is the worst our society can stoop to! 
Then these dustbins make movies on patriotism &amp; women? Trash! #MeToo

@DrShobha @KaushalyaAmrita @Aryathyagarajan @Nidhi @RahulGandhi @INCIndia @TimesNow @republic Maybe! Things will find balance again. It was extremely loaded on for the other side for years! Now it is a tearaway reaction &amp; will take time to settle.

Cleansing is always unsettling; Sanity is finally restored.

#MeToo is not 'scheduled maintainance'; it is a phenomenon.

@RanaAyyub Icons?
Many illusions will shatter for the better of humankind.
#MeToo

@BDUTT @terence_fdes Yes indeed! Bravery is one thing, chivalry or being a gentleman is something else.
Most in our times will not pass the test.
#MeToo

@FarzanaBaduel @suhelseth Thanks. #MeToo is about just that. 
Naming and shaming the (mob of) perpetrators out there who have not a morsel of self control or civil behaviour even when on stage at a public function (being recorded or live for audiences).

Evil in public will behave as monsters in private!

@nilanjanaroy @bainjal She is not telling the truth!

This is how few unkind readers will take her apart! She must be damn reliving the whole ordeal; but will now be interrogated and reviled again!

STOP before you a write a word. Let your sisters read this first. Then comment on her &amp; #MeToo

@RSS26135927 @nilanjanaroy @bainjal Agree to your last line.
Define dignity and think about it without looking up a dictionary or Google, please.

The #women who have come forward and named their aggressors have already risked shame &amp; their own character assassination by hundreds who refuse to believe them! #MeToo

@calamur The domain stinks worse than a landfill.
How inept, apathetic &amp; even complicit organizations/managements have been? #Women employees harassed /assaulted at work! 
Goes even against #Article21 of the #Constitution (Right to Life) &amp; Right to Work! Action against these Orgs? #MeToo

@OrchestraBrief @PrachetaB Is your bad experience a gold standard that devalues experiences of others!
If your experience has to be taken at face value &amp; understood so is all of theirs! It is not gendered!
It is a fight against brutal injustice; unfathomable exploitation &amp; misuse of position. #MeToo

@SaginaWalyat If a nation cannot protect its women anywhere...including violations of modesty at #workplace, then we need serious nation wide debates on every forum about the lacunae in all our rights &amp; laws despite which #women are visibly unsafe &amp; assualters undeterred.

#metoo 
#metooindia

@umesh110168 @TheRestlessQuil #MeTooIndia 2.0 will hit harder if people (read: predators) don't behave. There will be tech and gadgets all in there to nail such offensive acts.

The #MeToo movement was spontaneous, now women would have learnt &amp; will take guard.

That is the change &amp; awareness that is new.
